{"sba-keyaki-5137":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは〜。☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近リサが部屋の服を片付けてくれました。!\n服が多すぎて入りきらなかったのを、片づけてくれて。\n2人でせいやっ!よっ!わっしょっい!っていいながしてた(笑)\n結果3分の2くらい捨てました。\n気づいたら4時間もかっかてた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にリサありがとう。かっこよかった〜。リサが理想だね_( :⁍ 」 )_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHC51BBN2ED2BB4VHMF02F8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の秋は何の秋にしよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったね〜。"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-20701":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n こんにちは！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0J6FENM9HWH3PGTETPKZK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 先日は\n たくさんの人が\n おもてなし会に来てくださって\n とっても嬉しかったです♡\n \n \n ありがとうございました！\n \n \n \n 待ちに待った？\n うーん\n 目標にしてた日が\n あっという間にきて\n あっという間に終わってしまいました。\n \n \n \n とっても楽しかったのですが\n 後悔も多いです。\n \n \n まずは\n 私は放送部だったのですが\n \n 台本を棒読みになってしまったこととか\n 途中で挙動不振になってしまったこととか\n もっとトークでみなさんと\n 楽しむことができたんじゃないかとか\n 振り返ると\n 反省点ばっかりです。\n \n \n \n でもMCはとても楽しかったです。\n 今回、放送部をしてみてわかったことがあります。\n 私は人の前で話をすることが大好きです！\n \n \n だから\n ショールームとかも\n すっごく楽しかったんだなーって\n 思いました（笑）\n \n \n \n \n そして\n ダンス。。。\n \n \n あんなにあんなにあんなに\n みんなに教えてもらったのに\n 間違ってしまいました。\n \n \n \n 努力不足でした。\n \n \n \n \n 人より何倍もできないんだから\n もっと頑張るべきでした。\n \n \n \n \n お昼休憩とか\n 空き時間とかいっぱいあったのに\n みんなと一緒になって\n 私も休憩していました。\n \n \n \n みんなの倍以上やらなきゃいけなかったのに\n 少し頑張ったら\n すごく頑張った気になってて\n \n \n 私は少し頑張っただけで\n すっごく頑張った気分になっちゃうから\n だめだなって思いました。\n \n \n \n やり直せるなら\n もう一回やり直したいけど\n 本番は練習と違って\n 1回しかないから\n だからその1回のために\n みんな必死になって頑張るし\n 失敗できないしだからそれが\n いいんだと思うけど\n \n \n はあもうほんとに悔しいです。\n \n \n 申し訳ないです。\n \n \n \n \n \n やり直せるなら\n いっぱい練習して\n 戻ってやり直したいです。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n でも\n 今回のおもてなし会で\n もっと努力が必要なこととか\n いろいろなことを学びました。\n \n \n \n \n だから\n 後悔しないように\n 今以上に\n 日々いろいろなことを\n 頑張ります。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n いぐちまお。"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-10626":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日電車にのってたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで目的地に着いたから降りようと思ったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで混んでたから勢いよく出ようとしたら\n『ドンッッッ！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いったぁーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思って正面見たらまだ開いてなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドアが透明で綺麗だったので見えなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ恥ずかしかった和田まあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てーここだけクルクルに\nいつもやってもらってるヘアーメイクさんにやられたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざとだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフツインしよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って\n冗談でメンバーと話してたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら冗談で言ったの知ってるのに、まぁやのとこにきて\nハーフツインやって来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁおかげで皆に写メ撮られてモテモテだったけど......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアーメイクさんもとっても楽しい方なんだ〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして最近\n『ファニーボーン』\nっていう言葉を覚えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでメンバーに何回も自慢したんだけど皆知っててショックだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから\n白石まいちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川まいちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村さゆりちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後ひなちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山かずみちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、まぁや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、最近覚えたて言葉や難しい言葉を話してました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、まいまいから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ゲシュタルトホウカイ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう言葉を教えてもらったよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかわかる!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで今日はろってぃーからスカートもらった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前は上着くれたし......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと嬉し〜気持ち!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←（ロティー語だよ♪）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント今回も素敵な言葉をありがとう♪\nまあやってそんなふうに思ってもらえてるんだ〜って思えて、もっともっと皆が笑顔になれるよう頑張ります〜!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではテスト勉強しなきゃなので"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-22807":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじまりはじまりぃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/02/13/3902897/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/02/13/3902897/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/02/13/3902897/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/02/13/3902897/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/02/13/3902897/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/02/13/3902897/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin61